@startuml
title Admin User - Create User (POST /api/admin/users)
hide footbox
actor Client
participant UserController
participant AppUserService
participant AppUserRepository
participant PasswordEncoder
participant GlobalExceptionHandler as GEH

Client -> UserController: POST /api/admin/users {username, email, password, role, status?}
note right of Client: Already authenticated by JwtAuthenticationFilter\nSecurityConfig: /api/admin/** requires role ADMIN

alt Request body fails @Valid (blank fields, invalid email, password shorter than 6, role is null)
    UserController --> GEH: MethodArgumentNotValidException
    GEH --> Client: 400 Bad Request (field errors)
else Request body is valid
    UserController -> AppUserService: createUser(request)
    AppUserService -> AppUserRepository: existsByUsername(username)
    AppUserRepository --> AppUserService: boolean

    alt Username already exists
        AppUserService --> UserController: throw DuplicateResourceException
        UserController --> GEH: DuplicateResourceException
        GEH --> Client: 409 Conflict
    else Username is available
        AppUserService -> AppUserRepository: existsByEmail(email)
        AppUserRepository --> AppUserService: boolean

        alt Email already exists
            AppUserService --> UserController: throw DuplicateResourceException
            UserController --> GEH: DuplicateResourceException
            GEH --> Client: 409 Conflict
        else Email is available
            AppUserService -> PasswordEncoder: encode(request.getPassword())
            PasswordEncoder --> AppUserService: encoded password

            alt request.getStatus() != null
                AppUserService -> AppUserService: status = request.getStatus()
            else request.getStatus() == null
                AppUserService -> AppUserService: status = ACTIVE
            end

            AppUserService -> AppUserService: user = AppUser.builder().username(..).email(..).password(..).role(..).status(..).build()
            AppUserService -> AppUserRepository: save(user)
            AppUserRepository --> AppUserService: saved AppUser
            AppUserService -> AppUserService: UserResponse.from(savedUser)
            AppUserService --> UserController: UserResponse
            UserController --> Client: 201 Created (UserResponse)
        end
    end
end
@enduml